{
  "workflowId": "300000331068269",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_HCM_HRM_SUCCESSION_PLANNING_ASSISTANT_TEAM",
  "name": "Succession Planning Assistant",
  "description": "Assists managers in the succession planning of their team by creating succession plans, updating succession plans, adding internal and external candidates to succession plans, fetching succession plan details, creating external candidate details, updating a candidate's ranking, readiness, status and interim successor flag, and listing the history of changes for a succession plan.",
  "specification": {
    "dataPipeline": {
      "pipelineNodes": [
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Start of data pipeline",
            "name": "Start"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768508593537"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 12249.7021484375,
            "y": 5000
          },
          "code": "START",
          "id": "start",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "START"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Data From User Input"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768508880589"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 12121.7021484375,
            "y": 5206
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_DATA_FROM_USER_INPUT",
          "id": "1768508593537",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768508593540_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "###ROLE\nYou are performing literal string extraction.\n\n###GOAL\nExtract text from {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}, and write the text to the following properties: planName, personName, personNumber, planAccessType (as Public or Private), planType (as Job, Incumbent, or Position), jobOrPositionName, candidateName, candidatePersonNumber, isExternalCandidate (as true or false), ranking, readiness, interimSuccessorFlag (as 'Y' or 'N'), and candidateStatus.  \n\nSet withinMyTeam to true only when the user explicitly refers to the user's own team or organization, using first-person ownership language such as:\n- \"my team\"\n- \"my organization\"\n- \"under me\"\n- \"my direct reports\"\n- \"on my team\"\n- \"reports to me\"\n\nSet withinMyTeam to false when the text refers to another person's team, even if it contains phrases like:\n- \"James Douglas's direct reports\"\n- \"his team\"\n- \"their reports\"\n- \"Connor's team\"\n\n### ALGORITHM\nFollow these steps strictly in order:\n1. Extract the text within single quotes or double quotes, and write to appropriate properties. For example, if plan name is provided inside quotes, extract the text inside quotes exactly as-is, and write to planName.\n2. Extract the rest of the properties from the phrases outside single quotes or double quotes, do not derive any property values from the text extracted in Step 1.\n3. Under no circumstances should other properties be derived from or copied from planName.\n4. Only extract planName if a specific, explicitly named plan is present.\n\n### RULES\n- If the input contains the word \"plan\" or \"succession plan\" near the quoted text, assign the entire quoted string exactly as-is to planName.\n- Do NOT split or partially assign the quoted string to personName, planType or planAccessType.\n- If the word \"plan\" or \"succession plan\" is not present near the quoted text, apply other contextual rules.\n- Do NOT extract \"<person name>'s succession plan\" as planName.  If no planName is explicitly mentioned, set planName to \"\".\n- Always ensure personName, personNumber, planAccessType, planType are extracted independently from planName.\n- Always return \"\" for any unspecified or undetermined properties.\n- If personName is empty or null, AND candidateName is not empty or null, AND isExternalCandidate is false, then set personName = candidateName. Otherwise, keep personName as originally extracted.\n- If personNumber is empty or null, AND candidatePersonNumber is not empty or null, AND isExternalCandidate is false, then set personNumber = candidatePersonNumber. Otherwise, keep personNumber as originally extracted.\n\n### EXAMPLE\n- Does [personName] have any succession plans?\n- Show me succession plans for [personName].\n- Show full details for [planName].\n- Give me Succession plan details for [personName].\n- Show me all succession plans that [personName] is a candidate of.\n- Show me all successors for [personName]'s plan.\n- I would like to create a [planType] type succession plan for [personName] with name [planName].\n- Add [candidateName] to [personName]'s succession plan with rank=[rank], readiness=[readiness].\n- Add external candidate [candidateName] to [planName].\n- Show me the succession plans for role [jobOrPositionName].\n- Update [candidateName] with rank [rank], readiness [readiness].\n- Change [candidateName]'s status to [candidateStatus] in the plan [planName].\n- What are the changes made to [planName]."
            },
            {
              "id": "1768508593537_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"planName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"personName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"personNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"planAccessType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"planType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"jobOrPositionName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"candidateName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"candidatePersonNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"isExternalCandidate\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"ranking\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"readiness\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"interimSuccessorFlag\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"candidateStatus\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"withinMyTeam\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "",
