          },
          "code": "GET_USER_INTENT",
          "id": "1768612500933",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768612500934_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Available Options:**\n1. ** General inquires to find succession plans and candidates details FOR/OF an employee.  In this case set userIntent to \"INCUMBENT_INTENT\". Examples below\n         - Show me David’s succession plan\n         - Show succession plans for Larry.\n         - List Kumar’s successors \n         - What is the readiness status for successors of Patricia Mahan\n         - Does Emily Grindstaff have a succession plan?\n         - Show me Succession plan details for James Harris\n         - Are there any ready-now candidates for Murali Kota?\n         - Share succession plan details for Joseph Lawrence\n         - Show me all successors of Marc Konas\n2. ** Inquires to find succession plans where an employee is an candidate. In this case set userIntent to \"SUCCESSOR_INTENT\". Examples below\n         - What plans is Charles a candidate in?    \n         - Where is John a potential successor?    \n         - Is James Douglas a potential successor on any of the succession plans?\n3. ** Inquires to find a specific succession plan detail, or succession plan detail of a job/position. In this case set userIntent to \"SHOW_PLAN_DETAIL\". Examples below\n         - Show full details for Senior Manager Succession Plan  \n         - Who are the candidates present in Operations manager position succession plan?\n         - Show me succession plans for 'Operations Manager'\n         - Are there any succession plans for 'Operations Manager'?\n         - Who are the potential successors for the CHRO position?\n         - Share the details of potential successors and their readiness levels for VP of Operations\n         - Show internal vs external successor options for VP of Operations\n4. ** Inquires to create a succession plan for a person. In this case set userIntent to \"CREATE_PLAN\". Examples below\n         - Create a succession plan for David\n         - I would like to create a succession plan for David with name 'David Job Plan'\n         - Create a public succession plan for David\n         - Create an Incumbent type succession plan for David\n         - Create a public job type succession plan for David\n5. ** Inquires to add candidate to an existing plan or a plan of an employee. In this case set userIntent to \"ADD_CANDIDATE\". Examples below\n         - Add Rachel to David's succession plan\n         - Add Rachel to Senior Manager Succession Plan\n         - Add an external candidate called 'Roshan Ram' to the plan with the following details\n         - Add Roshan Ram as an external candidate to this plan\n6. ** Inquires to update candidate's ranking, readiness, interim successor or status in a succession plan. In this case set userIntent to \"UPDATE_CANDIDATE\". Examples below\n         - Update the rank of Rachel for this succession plan\n         - Update ranking of Rachel to 3\n         - Update the readiness level of Rachel for this succession plan\n         - Set the readiness level of Rachel to Ready in 1-2 years\n         - Update external candidate Rachel's readiness level to Ready Now\n         - Update interim successor flag of Rachel for this succession plan to Y\n         - Set Rachel as interim successor for this plan\n         - Remove interim flag for Rachel in 'David Job Plan'\n7. ** Inquires to show a succession plan's revision/history. In this case set userIntent to \"SHOW_PLAN_REVISION\". Examples below\n         - What changes were made to this plan recently?\n         - Show me the changes made to this plan for the past 3 months\n         - View plan history for the past 1 month\n         - How long has David been in the same readiness level on Rachel Succession Plan?\n         - Has the readiness of David changed year over year on this plan?\n8. ** Inquires that are not supported.  In this case set userIntent to \"NOT_SUPPORTED\".  Action to delete plan, plan candidate, plan owners are not supported.  Actions such as add owner, update owner are not supported.  Actions related to succession plan alerts are not supported.\nExamples below\n         - Remove Rachel from the succession plan\n         - Delete the succession plan for David\n         - Add Owner Rachel to the succession plan\n         - Update Owner type as Candidate Manager for Rachel in the plan\n\n**Analysis Instructions:**\n\n1. **Context Analysis**: Review the complete chat history to understand conversation flow and previous engagements\n2. **Intent Classification**: Identify the primary ask from the user\n3. **Selection Logic**:\n - Select appropriate path based on the three options you have\n - You will output only one path.\n - Apply contextual continuity: if the previous message targeted specific path and the current message is ambiguous or follows up, use that information to pick your path\n4. **Output Format**: Return a string whose value must be one of the following: \"INCUMBENT_INTENT\", \"SUCCESSOR_INTENT\", \"SHOW_PLAN_DETAIL\", \"CREATE_PLAN\", \"ADD_CANDIDATE\", \"UPDATE_CANDIDATE\", \"SHOW_PLAN_REVISION\".\n**Current User Message:** {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n**History Message:** {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"userIntent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
