            "sourceCode": "var planCandidates = $context.$variables.planDetail.successionPlanCandidates.items;\nfor (let i = 0; i < planCandidates .length; i++) {\n    if (planCandidates[i].ExternalCandidateId === $context.$nodes.FIND_EXTERNAL_CANDIDATE.$output.items[0].ExternalCandidateId) {\n         return true;\n    }\n}\n\nreturn false;"
